2025-05-03 02:56:44,317 - RESPONSE: {"status": "500 INTERNAL SERVER ERROR", "headers": {"Content-Type": "text/html; charset=utf-8", "Content-Length": "3426", "Vary": "Cookie"}, "body": "[Text content truncated to 2048 bytes]", "body_sample": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Error - MMO Game</title>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Orbitron:wght@400;700&family=Roboto:wght@300;400;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <style>\n        :root {\n            --primary-color: #3a10e5;\n            --secondary-color: #ff5722;\n            --dark-color: #1e1e2f;\n            --light-color: #f5f5f5;\n            --error-color: #e74c3c;\n        }\n        \n        * {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n        \n        body {\n            font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--dark-color), #2d2d44);\n            color: var(--light-color);\n            min-height: 100vh;\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: center;\n            align-items: center;\n            padding: 20px;\n        }\n        \n        .container {\n            max-width: 600px;\n            width: 100%;\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);\n            border-radius: 20px;\n            padding: 40px;\n            box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);\n            text-align: center;\n            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n        }\n        \n        h1 {\n            font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;\n            font-size: 2.2rem;\n            margin-bottom: 30px;\n            color: var(--error-color);\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n            letter-spacing: 2px;\n            text-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(231, 76, 60, 0.7);\n        }\n        \n        .error-details {\n            background: rgba(231, 76, 60, 0.1);\n            padding: 20px;\n            border-radius: 10px;\n            margin-bottom: 30px;\n            border: 1px solid rgba(231, 76, 60, 0.2);\n            text-align: left;\n        }\n        \n        .error-details p {\n            margin-bottom: 10"}
